      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree bd393f2e8921f32c1a644b6fd7e7a1d478bc0326\nparent 4303f3b7f0775cdbbe77faddf142e1e44fa590ca\nauthor Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1792039758 +0200\ncommitter Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1792513676 +0200\n\nlog: escape C1 control characters in messages\n\nLogEscapeMessage escapes bytes below 0x20 and 0x7f, but passes the\nUTF-8 encodings of U+0080 to U+009F (0xC2 0x80 to 0xC2 0x9F), which\ninclude CSI, OSC and DCS. VTE-based terminals, such as GNOME Terminal,\nact on them.\n\nEscape these two-byte sequences as well. 0xC2 is never a continuation\nbyte, so no decoder state is needed, and every other UTF-8 sequence\nstill passes through unaltered.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRJ5SMZs3eEinN+Lb4iedqLwmlHIAUCateWjBsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQInnai8JpRyAfsAD/ZeNrYe5HaXp7mkAuo09G\n8D4hJxa268SkfWkOdLrLMtYA/RhbodgbtMxp2C2vS5SoUpTNxBTGyxOH1XInw9Jc\nlvID\n=a7Dd\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
      },
      "parents": [
        {
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/commits/4303f3b7f0775cdbbe77faddf142e1e44fa590ca",
